    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d777">

                <pb facs="0930" n="914" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg914"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711F.1914/8–1747: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hines</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panamá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-08-17T10:00:00-05:00">August 17, 1947—10
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>457. Deptel 337, August 16. Embassy favors presenting to Panama draft G with
                    recommended modifications. This would avoid number of auxiliary notes.</p>
                <p>Should Panama strongly oppose, we should then present Department’s revision of
                    Alfaro proposal on “take it or leave it” basis.</p>
                <p>Embassy believes issue if handled as indicated can be concluded by September.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hines</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
